docs {
  # List Attachments

  **Method:** `GET`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments`
  **Auth:** None (Public)

  ## Description

  Queries attachments with dynamic filtering (`type`, `group_id`, `expense_id`, `uploaded_by_user_id`, `is_public`, and `search` on filename) with pagination metadata.

  ## Request

  ### Query Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `page` | `int` | No | Page number (default: `1`) |
  | `page_size` | `int` | No | Items per page (default: `20`) |
  | `type` | `string` | No | Filter by attachment type |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | No | Filter by squad/group ID |
  | `expense_id` | `int64` | No | Filter by expense ID |
  | `uploaded_by_user_id` | `int64` | No | Filter by uploader user ID |
  | `is_public` | `boolean` | No | Filter by public flag |
  | `search` | `string` | No | Search query for filename |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "uploaded_by_user_id": 1,
          "type": "PROFILE_IMAGE",
          "original_filename": "avatar.png",
          "object_key": "attachments/profile_image/2026/11/550e8400_avatar.png",
          "mime_type": "image/png",
          "file_size_bytes": 1048576,
          "is_public": true,
          "access_url": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/doratou-storage/attachments/profile_image/2026/11/550e8400_avatar.png"
        }
      ],
      "total_count": 1,
      "page": 1,
      "page_size": 10,
      "total_pages": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
